            "sourceCode": "let timespanResponse = $context.$nodes.PAYMENTS_TIMESPAN_AND_FREQUENCY_EXTRACTION.$output;\nlet scheduledTimeResponse = $context.$nodes.SCHEDULED_TIME_DERIVATION_2.$output;\n\nlet response = {\n  executionTime: timespanResponse?.executionTime,\n  timezone: timespanResponse?.timezone,\n  timespan: timespanResponse?.timespan,\n  periodic: timespanResponse?.periodic,\n  scheduleTime: scheduledTimeResponse?.scheduleTime\n};\n\nreturn response"
